"Picture 1 It is Mother’s Day. Leo (the boy covering his face) and his family have all gathered at Grandma’s house to celebrate. They have even brought a delicious looking cake with them for everyone to make the celebration even more special. Grandma is cutting the cake as Leo and the other grandchildren eagerly wait for a piece.": "c4e84b95289a",
